or otherwise obtains the Software.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Software that involves:
  (a) redistribution of the Software in binary, containerised, or
      source form to third parties;
  (b) embedding or integrating the Software into a commercial product
      or service offered to third parties;
  (c) offering the Software as part of a paid SaaS platform or
      managed service;
  (d) white-label or OEM integration; or
  (e) any use in a production environment that supports revenue-generating
      business operations.

"Evaluation Use" means use of the Software solely for the purposes of:
  (a) local cloning and execution for technical evaluation;
  (b) testing functionality and behaviour;
  (c) building internal proofs of concept that are not deployed in
      production; and
  (d) reviewing architecture for due diligence or procurement decisions.

